ll.avi\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">here</a>.\n\nAnd this movie was featured on an episode of Frightmares the Series hosted on the Internet Archive <a href=\"http://www.archive.org/details/FrightmarestheseriesTheHouseonHauntedHill\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">here</a>.", "date": "1959", "year": "1959", "subject": "haunted house; Vincent Price; horror; murder; suspense; ghosts", "licenseurl": "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/publicdomain/", "publicdate": "2008-07-20 08:29:12", "addeddate": "2008-07-20 08:28:22", "uploader": "dondeeley@gmail.com", "updater": ["drworm01", "twainbough", "drworm01"], "updatedate": ["2008-07-20 08:39:04", "2008-07-20 19:41:15", "2008-08-18 05:54:21"], "director": "William Castle", "publisher": "William Castle Productions", "sound": "sound", "color": "black & white", "runtime": "1:14:43", "language": "English", "backup_location": "ia903602_6", "closed_captioning": "no"}, "reviews": [{"reviewbody": "The MPEG-2 encoding here is the best available version on archive.org.  The plot summary is incorrect, however, as they were promised $10,000 each.\n\nI always enjoy Vincent Price movies.  He has a screen presence that's hard to ignore.  It's worth a download just to see Vincent Price in action even if you aren't a suspense/horror movie fan.\n\nOverall, this is a fun movie but you have to stretch your imagination (and ignore circumstances) at times.  This is one of the best public domain movies on archive.org.", "reviewtitle": "Best version of this movie on archive.org", "reviewer": "zythmer", "reviewdate": "2008-08-17 03:28:39", "createdate": "2008-08-17 03:28:39", "stars": "5"}, {"reviewbody": "Please answer guys, is this in widescreen or fullscreen format?  I have the fullscreen version & it's quite a disappointment, I don't want to redownload something that I already have.", "reviewtitle": "screen format", "reviewer": "zeneida", "reviewdate": "2009-06-03 19:43:33", "createdate": "2009-06-03 19:43:33", "stars": "0"}, {"reviewbody": "This movie has so many scenes that are just plain creepy, one of my absolute favorites.", "reviewtitle": "Creepy, lovely", "reviewer": "thestril", "reviewdate": "2009-07-20 16:00:56", "createdate": "2009-07-20 16:00:56", "stars": "4"}, {"reviewbody": "A thoroughly enjoyable way over the top camp horror classic.\nI remember when it was first shown in the theatres,they had a skeleton dancing on wires over the audience just as the on screen skeleton was putting paid to Vincent's wife.\nYou can't beat that!", "reviewtitle": "What a scream", "reviewer": "keygrip", "reviewdate": "2009-10-15 20:51:26", "createdate": "2009-08-29 20:32:13", "stars": "4"}, {"reviewbody": "This exchange from Tim Burton's 1994 film ED WOOD comes to mind:\n\n--\nEd Wood: If you take that crap and put a star in it, then you've got something!\n\nGeorge Weiss: Yeah. Crap with a star.\n--\n\nOne star for Vinnie. None for Castle.", "reviewtitle": "Castle of Crap", "reviewer": "cosmicolada", "reviewdate": "2009-08-29 21:52:47", "createdate": "2009-08-29 21:52:47", "stars": "1"}, {"reviewbody": "The value of the movie is unquestionable (though someone found common places \nwith Ed Wood!?).I had not seen the original till now but just the remake with Geoffrey\nRush in the place of the millionaire.Now i think that we should give a \"ghost party\"\nto all remake directors with the hope that none of them would come out alive!\nReally watching movies like this makes me shout PLEASE NO MORE REMAKES!", "reviewtitle": "Haunted remakes", "reviewer": "agapocine", "reviewdate": "2009-10-21 13:48:07", "createdate": "2009-10-21 13:48:07", "stars": "3"}, {"reviewbody": "one of my all time favorites, I just love those creepy sound effects, chains rattling and that spooky laughing. \n\nAnd of course there's Carol Ohmart (vincent price's wife) she's a real babe.", "reviewtitle": "saw it when I was a kid", "reviewer": "whiskeycat", "reviewdate": "2010-01-24 01:44:19", "createdate": "2010-01-24 01:44:19", "stars": "5"}, {"reviewbody": "This movie was a real treat and I enjoyed how simple , yet terrifying it was. With great acting and the psychology beyond all the creepiness in the film it deserves 5 stars.", "reviewtitle": "One Creepy Hill", "reviewer": "Thanatos333", "reviewdate": "2010-05-29 13:06:28", "createdate": "2010-05-29 13:06:28", "stars": "5"}, {"reviewbody": "I found this movie in a set ( 3 movies on one dvd)\n\nhttp://www.amazon.co.uk/Classic-Horrors-Silver-Screen-Haunted/dp/B00066883Y/ref=pd_sim_d_h_2", "reviewtitle": "on DVD", "reviewer": "Peter Cushing Hammer Horror", "reviewdate": "2011-09-14 09:56:37", "createdate": "2011-09-14 09:56:37", "stars": "4"}, {"reviewbody": "Why if this is public domain content did youtube pull it, placing a copyright strike on my account?\nIt said something about this being the master copy \nYoutube is riddled with contradiction. They ask that you not to upload copyrighted content, yet most of their content is just that. Music, TV shows, movies,uploaded by consumers. If you do it anyway, they'll tell you it's up to the copyright holder to decide if their material should be pulled. So basically they're saying, don't, but you (like millions of others) just might get away with it.\nIt's either copyrighted or it's not & if this movie is in the public domain it shouldn't get yanked. But in typical youtube style others are still online.", "reviewtitle": "Youtube Pulled It", "reviewer": "archiveto", "reviewdate": "2012-06-02 12:25:59", "createdate": "2012-06-02 12:25:59", "stars": "5"}, {"reviewbody": "moongleam- all caps dont make you right! And pointing out a strangers purported \"ignorance\" does nothing to admonish yourself of the same identifier. Whilst the film itself is indeed,\"supposedly\" public domain, the music in the film was in fact renewed. Here's the info requested:\n\nType of Work: Music\nRegistration Number / Date: RE0000309723 / 1986-11-17\nRenewal registration for: EU0000546955 / 1958-10-20\nTitle: House on Haunted Hill. From House on Haunted Hill. w Richard Kayne, m Richard Loring.\nCopyright Claimant: Richard Kayne & Richard Loring (A)\nVariant title: House on Haunted Hill\nNames: Kayne, Richard\nLoring, Richard\n\nArchive.org has been notified of this.", "reviewtitle": "NOT PUBLIC DOMAIN DO NOT UPLOAD TO YOUTUBE", "reviewer": "retro guy", "reviewdate": "2012-06-11 23:04:16", "createdate": "2012-06-11 18:42:53", "stars": "5"}, {"reviewbody": "<font size=\"+1\">To to the ignorant who say that this is not public domain: all U.S. films released before 1964 had to have their copyrights renewed after 28 years.\n\n<b>Show us the copyright renewal for this film.</b>  It is mindless to come here and claim that this is under copyright without showing the copyright renewal.\n\nFor example, here is the renewal for another William Castle film:\n\n<font size=\"-1\">\n13 ghosts. By William Castle Productions. \nType of Work:\tMotion Picture\nRegistration Number / Date:\tRE0000377853 / 1988-03-01 \n\tRenewal registration for: LP0000017292 / 1960-07-01 \nTitle:\t13 ghosts. By William Castle Productions.\nCopyright Claimant:\tColumbia Pictures Industries, Inc. (PWH)\n\t\nVariant title:\t13 ghosts.\nNames:\tWilliam Castle Productions.\n\tColumbia Pictures Industries, Inc.\n</font>\n\n<b>There is no copyright renewal for this film.</b>  There seems to be a renewal for music that is found in the film, but that does not keep the movie from being public domain.  The company that made the movie obtained a license to use that music in the film.  (The copyright on the movie would have been renewed by Allied Artists Pictures, not by Richard Kayne & Richard Loring.)\n\nHere is the original registration for the movie (with OCR typos):\n\nHOUSE ON HAUNTED HILL. Allied ArtlatB\nPictures Corp. 75 mln., sd., b&w,\n35 mm. (c) Allied Artlats Pictures\nCorp.; 29Dec58 (in notice: 1959);\nLP12531.\n\n\nNote that the original registration number is LP12531, not EU0000546955.\n\nAlso, Alpha Video sells this.\n\nAnd do not come to the Archive to complain about youtube.  The Archive has no control over the idiots at youtube.</font>", "reviewtitle": "Ignorant", "reviewer": "Moongleam", "reviewdate": "2012-06-12 00:13:55", "createdate": "2012-06-11 22:40:40", "stars": "0"}, {"reviewbody": "I enjoyed this film. The characters were interesting, as was the classic switch from fake to real spooks; it's as if I were possessed to watch it.", "reviewtitle": "fun", "reviewer": "awww", "reviewdate": "2014-01-17 13:42:19", "createdate": "2014-01-17 13:42:19", "stars": "4"}, {"reviewtitle": "iam adviser", "reviewbody": "\u0648\u064e\u0623\u064e\u0646\u0650\u064a\u0628\u064f\u0648\u0627 \u0625\u0650\u0644\u064e\u0649 \u0631\u064e\u0628\u0651\u0650\u0643\u064f\u0645\u0652 \u0648\u064e\u0623\u064e\u0633\u0652\u0644\u0650\u0645\u064f\u0648\u0627 \u0644\u064e\u0647\u064f \u0645\u0650\u0646 \u0642\u064e\u0628\u0652\u0644\u0650 \u0623\u064e\u0646 \u064a\u064e\u0623\u0652\u062a\u0650\u064a\u064e\u0643\u064f\u0645\u064f \u0627\u0644\u0652\u0639\u064e\u0630\u064e\u0627\u0628\u064f \u062b\u064f\u0645\u0651\u064e \u0644\u064e\u0627 \u062a\u064f\u0646\u0635\u064e\u0631\u064f\u0648\u0646\u064e\n\"Turn ye to our Lord (in repentance) and bow to His (Will), before the Penalty comes on you: after that ye shall not be helped\n\u0648\u064e\u0627\u062a\u0651\u064e\u0628\u0650\u0639\u064f\u0648\u0627 \u0623\u064e\u062d\u0652\u0633\u064e\u0646\u064e \u0645\u064e\u0627 \u0623\u064f\u0646\u0632\u0650\u0644\u064e \u0625\u0650\u0644\u064e\u064a\u0652\u0643\u064f\u0645 \u0645\u0651\u0650\u0646 \u0631\u0651\u064e\u0628\u0651\u0650\u0643\u064f\u0645 \u0645\u0651\u0650\u0646 \u0642\u064e\u0628\u0652\u0644\u0650 \u0623\u064e\u0646 \u064a\u064e\u0623\u0652\u062a\u0650\u064a\u064e\u0643\u064f\u0645\u064f \u0627\u0644\u0639\u064e\u0630\u064e\u0627\u0628\u064f \u0628\u064e\u063a\u0652\u062a\u064e\u0629\u064b \u0648\u064e\u0623\u064e\u0646\u062a\u064f\u0645\u0652 \u0644\u064e\u0627 \u062a\u064e\u0634\u0652\u0639\u064f\u0631\u064f\u0648\u0646\u064e\n\"And follow the best of (the courses) revealed to you from your Lord, before the Penalty comes on you - of a sudden while ye perceive not\n\u0623\u064e\u0646 \u062a\u064e\u0642\u064f\u0648\u0644\u064e \u0646\u064e\u0641\u0652\u0633\u064c \u064a\u064e\u0627 \u062d\u064e\u0633\u0652\u0631\u064e\u062a\u064e\u0649 \u0639\u0644\u064e\u0649 \u0645\u064e\u0627 \u0641\u064e\u0631\u0651\u064e\u0637\u062a\u064f \u0641\u0650\u064a \u062c\u064e\u0646\u0628\u0650 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0647\u0650 \u0648\u064e\u0625\u0650\u0646 \u0643\u064f\u0646\u062a\u064f \u0644\u064e\u0645\u0650\u0646\u064e \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0651\u064e\u0627\u062e\u0650\u0631\u0650\u064a\u0646\u064e\n\"Lest the soul should (then) say: 'Ah! Woe is me!- In that I neglected (my duty) towards Allah, and was but among those who mocked\n\u0623\u064e\u0648\u0652 \u062a\u064e\u0642\u064f\u0648\u0644\u064e \u0644\u064e\u0648\u0652 \u0623\u064e\u0646\u0651\u064e \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0647\u064e \u0647\u064e\u062f\u064e\u0627\u0646\u0650\u064a \u0644\u064e\u0643\u064f\u0646\u062a\u064f \u0645\u0650\u0646\u064e \u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u062a\u0651\u064e\u0642\u0650\u064a\u0646\u064e\n\"Or (lest) it should say: 'If only Allah had guided me, I should certainly have been among the righteous\nQuran . islam", "stars": "3", "reviewer": "lifego", "reviewdate": "2021-08-12 20:22:19", "createdate": "2021-08-12 20:22:19", "reviewer_itemname": "@lifego"}, {"reviewtitle": "Vincent Price at his best", "reviewbody": "One of my favorite films of all time... Sure Vincent Price has played all sorts of roles, in and out of the horror genre.. Some more flamboyant, some more unstable and crazy... But here, he comes off so dark yet sophisticated and it's perfect for this role... Classic spooky tropes, classic film to put you in a Halloween mood. ", "stars": "5", "reviewer": "Slade Craven", "reviewdate": "2021-09-15 22:39:10", "createdate": "2021-09-15 22:39:10", "reviewer_itemname": "@slade_craven"}, {"reviewtitle": "Garbage quality, should delete", "reviewbody": "If you're looking for a copy that doesn't look like it was shot on a potato, here: https://archive.org/details/house.on.-haunted.-hill.-1959.1080p.-blu-ray.-x-264-amiable", "stars": "1", "reviewer": "scrummycrunch", "reviewdate": "2023-04-20 21:39:16", "createdate": "2023-04-20 21:39:16", "reviewer_itemname": "@scrummycrunch"}], "server": "dn601208.us.archive.org", "simplelists": {"solo_manifest": {"solo_manifest_dn601208": {"sys_changed_by": {"source": "task", "task_id": "5455622770"}, "sys_last_changed": "2026-06-21 07:18:38.012021"}}}, "solo": true, "uniq": 809750983, "workable_servers": ["dn601208.us.archive.org"]}